@inject Diten.Web.Services.IPermissionSnapshot Perms
@*
    The pack §14 migration buttons for the page's script: action code → may this user see it. The script asks
    window.TraceUi.can('MARKTYPO') — it never names a permission key. Display only: [HasPermission] on the service stays
    the authority (UAS-001 §4).
*@
<script id="trace-actions" type="application/json">@Json.Serialize(Diten.Web.Models.Traceability.TraceActions.MigrationAllowedFor(Perms))</script>
